<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--The following translations were generated by https://www.deepl.com/-->
  <!-- EN: Aquaphile -->
  <GBKT_Aquaphile.degreeDatas.Aquaphile.label>水族爱好者</GBKT_Aquaphile.degreeDatas.Aquaphile.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} loves being wet. They have trained to survive in wet climates better than anyone else.{PAWN_pronoun} can wade through water at a dead sprint, and can aim through sheets of rain like it was a clear day. -->
  <GBKT_Aquaphile.degreeDatas.Aquaphile.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 喜欢潮湿。{PAWN_pronoun}能以死命冲刺的速度涉水而过，并能像晴天一样在大雨中瞄准目标。</GBKT_Aquaphile.degreeDatas.Aquaphile.description>
  <!-- EN: Battle Thrill -->
  <GBKT_BattleThrill.degreeDatas.Battle_Thrill.label>战斗快感</GBKT_BattleThrill.degreeDatas.Battle_Thrill.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} gets a thrill from being in the thick of battle. Nothing else is quite like it. They get some enjoyment out of honing their battle skills. -->
  <GBKT_BattleThrill.degreeDatas.Battle_Thrill.description>{PAWN_nameDef}从激烈的战斗中获得快感。没有什么能与之媲美。他们从磨练战斗技巧中获得一些乐趣。</GBKT_BattleThrill.degreeDatas.Battle_Thrill.description>
  <!-- EN: Care Giver -->
  <GBKT_CareGiver.degreeDatas.Care_Giver.label>照顾者</GBKT_CareGiver.degreeDatas.Care_Giver.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} derives confidence from taking care of others, and bringing a sick friend happiness is what brings them joy in turn. -->
  <GBKT_CareGiver.degreeDatas.Care_Giver.description>{PAWN_nameDef}从照顾他人中获得自信，给生病的朋友带来快乐也会给自己带来快乐。</GBKT_CareGiver.degreeDatas.Care_Giver.description>
  <!-- EN: Couch Potato -->
  <GBKT_CouchPotato.degreeDatas.Couch_Potato.label>沙发土豆</GBKT_CouchPotato.degreeDatas.Couch_Potato.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} prefers sitting and passively looking at works of art, preferably television In fact, they get so into what they are viewing its like their metabolism slows down. -->
  <GBKT_CouchPotato.degreeDatas.Couch_Potato.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 喜欢坐着被动地欣赏艺术作品，最好是电视。</GBKT_CouchPotato.degreeDatas.Couch_Potato.description>
  <!-- EN: Dirt Aficionado -->
  <GBKT_DirtLover.degreeDatas.Dirt_Aficionado.label>污垢爱好者</GBKT_DirtLover.degreeDatas.Dirt_Aficionado.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} loves the feeling of dirt between their toes.  And fingers.  And teeth.  {PAWN_pronoun} enjoys the appearance and taste of raw nature in all its glorious mess, and will accidentally spread some of that raw mess wherever they go. -->
  <GBKT_DirtLover.degreeDatas.Dirt_Aficionado.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 喜欢脚趾间泥土的感觉。  还有手指。  还有牙齿。  {PAWN_pronoun}喜欢大自然原生态的外表和味道，并会不小心把这些原生态的脏东西散播到他们所到之处。</GBKT_DirtLover.degreeDatas.Dirt_Aficionado.description>
  <!-- EN: Dreamer -->
  <GBKT_Dreamer.degreeDatas.Dreamer.label>梦想家</GBKT_Dreamer.degreeDatas.Dreamer.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef}'s best refuge is in the privacy of their mind. When discouraged, they tend to retreat into their own little world, and may actively seek such escape to their thoughts and their beds. -->
  <GBKT_Dreamer.degreeDatas.Dreamer.description>{PAWN_nameDef}最好的庇护所是他们的心灵隐私。当灰心丧气时，他们往往会退回到自己的小世界中，并可能会主动寻求这种逃避，回到自己的思想和床上。</GBKT_Dreamer.degreeDatas.Dreamer.description>
  <!-- EN: Energetic -->
  <GBKT_Energetic.degreeDatas.Energetic.label>精力充沛</GBKT_Energetic.degreeDatas.Energetic.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} rarely sits still. {PAWN_pronoun} tires less easily, but also needs more food to fuel their energy needs. -->
  <GBKT_Energetic.degreeDatas.Energetic.description>{PAWN_nameDef}很少坐着不动。{PAWN_pronoun} 不容易疲劳，但也需要更多食物来补充能量。</GBKT_Energetic.degreeDatas.Energetic.description>
  <!-- EN: Explorer -->
  <GBKT_Explorer.degreeDatas.Explorer.label>探索者</GBKT_Explorer.degreeDatas.Explorer.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} constantly craves new experiences and new things to see. {PAWN_pronoun} lives for the sole purpose of seeking that excitement anywhere they can find it. -->
  <GBKT_Explorer.degreeDatas.Explorer.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 不断渴望新的体验和新的事物。{PAWN_pronoun} 生活的唯一目的就是在任何地方寻找刺激。</GBKT_Explorer.degreeDatas.Explorer.description>
  <!-- EN: Foodie -->
  <GBKT_Foodie.degreeDatas.Foodie.label>美食家</GBKT_Foodie.degreeDatas.Foodie.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} derives joy from every exciting morsel of a meal they are eating. Savoring every bite is important to them. -->
  <GBKT_Foodie.degreeDatas.Foodie.description>{PAWN_nameDef}从每一餐令人兴奋的食物中获得快乐。品尝每一口食物对他们来说都很重要。</GBKT_Foodie.degreeDatas.Foodie.description>
  <!-- EN: Gamer -->
  <GBKT_Gamer.degreeDatas.Gamer.label>玩家</GBKT_Gamer.degreeDatas.Gamer.label>
  <!-- EN: For {PAWN_nameDef}, turning everything into a game activates their brain and makes any task all the more enticing. -->
  <GBKT_Gamer.degreeDatas.Gamer.description>对 {PAWN_nameDef} 来说，把一切都变成游戏能激活他们的大脑，让任何任务都变得更有吸引力。</GBKT_Gamer.degreeDatas.Gamer.description>
  <!-- EN: Homebody -->
  <GBKT_Homebody.degreeDatas.Homebody.label>宅男</GBKT_Homebody.degreeDatas.Homebody.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is happiest in their familiar local environs and surroundings. {PAWN_pronoun} additionally takes pride in keeping their space "just so", as this maintains its familiarity. To them, living at home is best. -->
  <GBKT_Homebody.degreeDatas.Homebody.description>{PAWN_nameDef}在自己熟悉的环境中最快乐。此外，{PAWN_pronoun} 还以保持自己的空间 "恰到好处 "为荣，因为这样可以保持熟悉感。对他们来说，住在家里是最好的。</GBKT_Homebody.degreeDatas.Homebody.description>
  <!-- EN: Meditative -->
  <GBKT_Meditative.degreeDatas.Meditative.label>冥想</GBKT_Meditative.degreeDatas.Meditative.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} finds their best source of calm in their own psyche.  {PAWN_pronoun}  devotes time to sit with their own thoughts, often reducing social contact to better think. -->
  <GBKT_Meditative.degreeDatas.Meditative.description>{PAWN_nameDef}在自己的心灵中找到平静的最佳源泉。  {PAWN_pronoun}花时间静静地思考，经常减少与社会的接触，以便更好地思考。</GBKT_Meditative.degreeDatas.Meditative.description>
  <!-- EN: Sky Gazer -->
  <GBKT_SkyGazer.degreeDatas.Sky_Gazer.label>天空瞻望者</GBKT_SkyGazer.degreeDatas.Sky_Gazer.label>
  <!-- EN: For whatever reason, where {PAWN_nameDef} was before, they missed out on seeing big blue skies - and now nothing brings them more joy than to see the wide open heavens above them. -->
  <GBKT_SkyGazer.degreeDatas.Sky_Gazer.description>不管出于什么原因，{PAWN_nameDef}以前所在的地方，他们错过了看到湛蓝天空的机会--而现在，没有什么比看到头顶上广阔的天空更能给他们带来快乐了。</GBKT_SkyGazer.degreeDatas.Sky_Gazer.description>
  <!-- EN: Snow Bunny -->
  <GBKT_SnowBunny.degreeDatas.Snow_Bunny.label>雪兔</GBKT_SnowBunny.degreeDatas.Snow_Bunny.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} loves winter and all things winter-related. -->
  <GBKT_SnowBunny.degreeDatas.Snow_Bunny.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 喜欢冬天和所有与冬天有关的事物。</GBKT_SnowBunny.degreeDatas.Snow_Bunny.description>
  <!-- EN: Socialite -->
  <GBKT_Socialite.degreeDatas.Socialite.label>社会名流</GBKT_Socialite.degreeDatas.Socialite.label>
  <!-- EN: Charismatic and active, {PAWN_nameDef} gets the most motivation from interacting with and collaborating with others. Getting so involved in the lives of others has benefits... and also downsides to having that kind of visibility.  -->
  <GBKT_Socialite.degreeDatas.Socialite.description>{PAWN_nameDef}富有魅力且活跃，他从与他人的互动和合作中获得了最大的动力。如此参与他人的生活有好处......但也有坏处。</GBKT_Socialite.degreeDatas.Socialite.description>
  <!-- EN: Sun Bather -->
  <GBKT_SunBather.degreeDatas.Sun_Bather.label>沐浴阳光</GBKT_SunBather.degreeDatas.Sun_Bather.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} enjoys being out in the sun and the effect it has on their skin. They are gonna soak up the sun! -->
  <GBKT_SunBather.degreeDatas.Sun_Bather.description>{PAWN_nameDef}喜欢晒太阳，喜欢阳光对皮肤的影响。他们会尽情享受阳光！</GBKT_SunBather.degreeDatas.Sun_Bather.description>
</LanguageData>
